This module is freshly written.  It is modelled on the memcached module that
ships with nginx -- the upstream content-handler shape, the $..._key variable,
the header/filter split -- which is under the same two-clause BSD terms held
by Igor Sysoev and Nginx, Inc.; no line of it is copied here.

